      "id": 6,
      "title": "Design and Implement Subscription Plans System",
      "description": "Create a flexible subscription plans system that allows platform administrators to define and manage the 4 specific AutomatizaSE pricing tiers: Hacker (Free), Startups, Business, and Enterprise",
      "status": "pending",
      "dependencies": [
        5
      ],
      "priority": "high",
      "details": "Create Plan model with attributes: name, description, price_cents (using Money gem), billing_interval, features_json, limits_json, stripe_price_id. Implement the 4 specific AutomatizaSE plans: Hacker (R$0/mês, up to 2 agents, 1 WhatsApp inbox, 500 conversations/month), Startups (R$95/agent/month with additional channels), Business (R$195/agent/month with teams and automation), and Enterprise (R$495/agent/month with custom AI and integrations). Implement PlanFeature and PlanLimit models for granular control of specific features like agent limits, conversation limits, channel access, and retention periods. Create admin interface for plan management using ActiveAdmin or custom Rails admin. Implement plan comparison logic and upgrade/downgrade paths between the 4 tiers. Set up automatic Stripe product and price creation for each plan. Create plan serializers for API responses including feature matrices. Configure specific plan limits: agents (2 for Hacker, unlimited for paid plans), inboxes (1 WhatsApp for Hacker, multiple channels for others), conversations (500/month for Hacker), and data retention (30 days for Hacker). Implement feature flags for channel access (Email, Facebook, Instagram, SMS, Telegram, etc.), advanced features (Teams, Automation, Campaigns), and integrations (CRM, Captain AI, External APIs).",
      "testStrategy": "Test creation of all 4 AutomatizaSE plans through admin interface. Verify Stripe products are created correctly for each pricing tier. Test plan comparison showing feature differences between Hacker, Startups, Business, and Enterprise. Validate specific plan limits are enforced: agent limits, conversation limits, channel restrictions, and retention periods. Test upgrade/downgrade paths between all plan combinations. Verify feature flags correctly enable/disable functionality based on plan tier. Test free Hacker plan doesn't create Stripe charges.",
      "subtasks": [
