      "id": 7,
      "title": "Build Customer Registration and Onboarding Flow",
      "description": "Create a comprehensive customer registration system with plan-specific Brazilian Portuguese onboarding experience for AutomatizaSE's 4 pricing tiers",
      "status": "pending",
      "dependencies": [
        3,
        4,
        6
      ],
      "priority": "high",
      "details": "Create multi-step registration form with Brazilian business information (company name, CNPJ, contact details) and plan selection. Implement email verification with AutomatizaSE branded templates. Create plan-specific onboarding wizards with progressive disclosure of features in Portuguese:\n\n🟢 Plano Hacker (Free): Simple registration without payment, mandatory WhatsApp inbox setup, optional Website Live Chat, tutorials for Private Notes, @mentions, Labels, Canned Responses, with clear limitation alerts (2 agents max, 500 conversations/month, 30 days retention).\n\n🚀 Plano Startups (R$95/agent/month): Registration with payment process, multi-channel setup (Email, Facebook, Instagram, additional WhatsApp, SMS, Telegram), Help Center and Custom Views/Filters configuration, Business Hours and Auto-responder tutorials, basic reporting introduction.\n\n💼 Plano Business (R$195/agent/month): Enterprise onboarding with Teams setup, Automation Rules and Agent Capacity configuration, Campaigns and CRM integration setup, complete CSAT/SLA reporting tutorials, Captain (Native AI) introduction.\n\n🏢 Plano Enterprise (R$495/agent/month): Dedicated onboarding with personalized support, external integrations setup (Google Calendar, Payment Gateways, ERP/CRM), Custom AI Agents configuration, corporate customization planning, advanced training sessions.\n\nImplement account isolation using row-level security or tenant-based architecture. Set up welcome email sequence with getting started guides in Portuguese. Create initial workspace setup with Brazilian business context. Implement user invitation system for team members. Add integration setup guides for popular Brazilian tools. Create contextual help system with Brazilian business examples. System must detect selected plan and guide users through plan-specific onboarding, enabling only corresponding features.",
      "testStrategy": "Test complete registration flow for each of the 4 plans from start to finish. Verify email verification works correctly with Brazilian email providers. Test account isolation ensures data separation between customers. Validate plan-specific onboarding wizards guide users effectively through appropriate setup for their tier. Test feature restrictions are properly enforced based on plan selection. Test user invitation system with different permission levels. Verify payment processing for paid plans. Test plan upgrade/downgrade scenarios during onboarding.",
      "subtasks": []
    },
    {
