      "details": "Implement Stripe Checkout Sessions for plan subscriptions with BRL pricing. Create payment processing controller with proper error handling and logging. Set up subscription creation and management using Stripe Subscriptions API. Implement proration logic for plan upgrades/downgrades. Create payment confirmation pages with AutomatizaSE branding. Set up automatic invoice generation and email delivery in Portuguese. Implement payment retry logic for failed payments. Create customer portal integration for payment method management. Add support for Brazilian payment methods and tax requirements. Implement webhook processing for subscription lifecycle events.",
      "testStrategy": "Test complete payment flow with Brazilian test cards. Verify subscription creation and activation works correctly. Test plan upgrade/downgrade scenarios with proper proration. Validate webhook processing handles all subscription events. Test payment failure and retry scenarios.",
